      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COLORADO SUN (1) showed good early gate speed from the wide gate first up, before knocking up in the straight to finish fifth over 1310m at this track. Regular rider hops back on and is expected to go close. ZIPPY LION (5) slashing return from back in the field to run fourth over 1310m at this track. Looking for this trip and further now and shapes as the main danger. WAVES OF WISDOM (4) stalked the speed at his second career start and failed to close off when fifth over 1400m at Canberra. Fitter now from the low draw and look for a better performance. MR REIBY (2) comes here with a fitness edge, and the extra trip is in his favour. Got out late when sixth over 1310m at this track. Look for him late.",
